{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13154","headline":"适荆州途次南阳赠何明府 · 皇甫冉","name":"适荆州途次南阳赠何明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"千里独游日，有怀谁与同。\n言过细阳令，一遇郎陵公。\n清节迈多士，斯文传古风。\n闾阎知俗变，原野识年丰。\n吾道方在此，前程殊未穷。\n江天经岘北，客思满巴东。\n梦渚夕愁远，山丘晴望通。\n应嗟出处异，流荡楚云中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皇甫冉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13154.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13154","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}